    "title": "Ellicottville Historical Society September Meeting & Upcoming Ghost Walks - NewsBreak",
    "text": "2 hours ago ELLICOTTVILLE - The Ellicottville Historical Society will meet on Wednesday, September 3rd at 7:00pm. Please note that the speaker for this month has changed. The new speaker will be Ellen Frank, Town Historian, and she will present “Behind the Scenes at the Abraham Lincoln Presidential Museum in Springfield, IL.” The meeting will take place at the Ellicottville Memorial Library, 6499 Maples Rd. and is open to the public free of charge. A short business meeting will precede. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
